      "created_at": "2012-04-16T17:22:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Because Wrest the Mind redirects damage, putting that sort of power on the Villain Character card neuters the Villain. It can be redirected at a minion, at an environment target, at a hero who has immunity to that sort of damage… even back at the villain itself!</p>\n<p>Vicious Cyclone is ‘just’ a damaging card.</p>",
